      "summary": "Source-bound model self-review: index.ts now calls three explicit policy entrypoints in order, with per-policy recovery, and accepts only configPath. No arbitrary definitions, registry, context factory, generic resource loader or discovery remains. Built-in policies read fixed injection URLs and own literal predicates; bounded input extraction and pure prompt transformation are ordinary data helpers. Legacy trigger-file helpers remain only for deferred scaffold compatibility, outside runtime imports. Config preserves enabled/disabled semantics, byte and diagnostic limits; unknown fields/names are diagnosed and whimsical is a deprecated no-op. Focused 25 tests pass including fuzz and boundary mutation checks. Scaffold integration and repository-wide qualification are W-3. This is self-review, not independent review.",
